<title>DUBAI: International Jewellery Dubai exhibition in March.</title>
<headline>International Jewellery Dubai exhibition in March.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The third &quot;International Jewellery Dubai&quot; exhibition will be held in the Gulf Arab emirate between March 26 and March 30, 1997, conference organisers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Antwerp-based Diamond High Council, the World Gold Council, the Gem and Jewellery Council of India and the Sri Lankan Gems Export Council are supporting the exhibition.</p>
<p>The Middle East's first international diamond conference will be held on March 26 as part of the exhibition.</p>
<p>Organisers expect 160 exhibitors from 26 countries.</p>
</text>
